\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {B1}{\ignorespaces Phase\nobreakspace  {}I pilot. (a) The delay-Hopf boundary of Eq.\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {eq:char} in the $(\beta \tau ,\, y)$ plane of Section\nobreakspace  {}4.1 at three $m/\beta $ contours (lines, left to right: $m/\beta = 10$, 1, 0.1); the anchored parameter box overlaid as pass (blue) / fail (grey) against the quantitative gate; $\times $ marks simulated oscillation onset, placed at $\tau = \tau _H$. (b) First-order Sobol indices of the gate indicator (covariance estimator, Saltelli $A/B$ matrices, $N=1024$, bootstrap 95\% confidence intervals): the envelope is set by timescales and demand ($\mu $, $w$, $\tau $, $\beta $), not by loop gain $y$.}}{12}{figure.A2.1}\protected@file@percent }
